://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MH_Wc5FS1OcQ7kNvwGXErHy&_nc_oc=Adri2mwA0574BdwkF8taSyv-25qlTKN1gFsnK_Sanu0zVGYzByJzTjmxVEM6LNZC-5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4Af6Ou2psQgFVD1R6R_39T9hbyf-sIrdN-kCyXjGijXA&oe=6A15B766"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GvOgAVDdLuwQ7kNvwGuy5AF&_nc_oc=AdrJNSpTr3kjDJ-XikXDwBhWO2VrqP5pMpjLMI_WmEWtNKPYkv1ORQj3h-RfB_S09A8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5PRlffHkWcCzUityItZBh9RH8aexwfEmqczf2hxBAmjw&oe=6A15ACB2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t7pkTNiWU54Q7kNvwEAyYZb&_nc_oc=Adrc8aUz4ZgvFqX_p8B0vsvxgAWZ0RsZ3TgRtrrM6PdPcepaK-YzJbIhEZTr3XaJsE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5fLYDm1tkhJE4hHmLcCzdGZEKWsCEvyxilv2eBETuJvg&oe=6A15A67B"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FL0_f13upBYQ7kNvwG4cBPd&_nc_oc=AdqcEG_VsrchUaYWHKGQzX9lIn4pd8peHWlzPhnPfuy0SA-h5pvMXr3MSFNFsDlhP9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6zGGFgOhGz6XcdNSKfYeDPhAgNEc1jR4M7eSDtaj8Fzw&oe=6A15BBF3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t283innD3PUQ7kNvwGUlBPe&_nc_oc=AdpHBTGXO0KNamOYejFKOLgLcSRRvkYAJWRccpTuWxNoywoAXX2yW8RqioozG_COBwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af50FJeJUkwcwglWZRYRObInIjGqlVkX3xj3Fwuev77Lnw&oe=6A15B9F2"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p4Xvd6uoSsEQ7kNvwEwFO3S&_nc_oc=AdrlV4qFWKjlzdgwQ0a4KfYww2p8zNiqwK1HvEmxqzLuBGa5EB0WLZeEZVYhDijOl-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5vcff6kdYPa0E2KmnnBnEsOlgtXW8I_VFyeQpiMEdVsg&oe=6A15B153"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=91EDiX9VaVAQ7kNvwG2OPCk&_nc_oc=Adp7zHAhLlX-X8xadL3ju41izimaYauvwYuXTN1TRTMsnNuXnqzS-PwggCRUvrgyPBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af52oCIjBOdQk4qkL1E6UHZab_XbyZ-ijIRUx4ZbbbkCug&oe=6A15AD6F"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qMqRzdo6PK8Q7kNvwE3ZizB&_nc_oc=Adpm1s3mxTRTrvzTwAeFGXUPSIN__KSkVOFgB6vS9KNfF6dPIXO8EjzfJI1WIBs2k_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5GJFqZ8CtfVBw27FmEEMq0HmqBAlSLwBGf9PLDSM7AUQ&oe=6A15B922"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_521808747164